    "Persistent Pending output slots exist before arbitrary compose; each concrete output adopted before postcheck. Failed/incomplete compose retains prefix; successful outputs move to actual Graph and retire on worker before Online cleanup.",
    "Online identity query runs outside metadata lock; caught nested path/auth/mutex/bind/run/ready/finish/stop mutation poisons outer admission.",
    "Settings dependency field order and take_settings guaranteed-prvalue sink protect normal and failed construction and clear internal SBO callable donors while receiving Composer/lifetime remain alive. Owning callers use public sink; external plain-moved donors retain external lifetime duties.",
    "Factory Options owns attempts first so automatic failed construction destroys opaque leaf captures first. Normal attached Retiring retirement explicitly destroys licensing/content/information settings before attempt cells.",
    "Provider facades are worker-affine; Factory-retained shared leaf/backing owners may have their last release on controller and must support that declared thread contract."
  ],
